# Agent law (drop into any repo root as AGENTS.md or append)

**Copyright (c) 2026 Martial Systems LLC.** MIT.

## Verify before done (mandatory)

Before claiming fixed, done, shipped, or “try it”:

1. Implement the change.  
2. Map every interaction path (entry points, modes, toggles, fallbacks, caches, mirrors, deploys, side effects).  
3. Sanity-check **all** of those paths.  
4. On failure → patch → re-check the full map.  
5. Report with the block below.

**Forbidden:** happy-path-only verification; unverified success claims.

### Required report block

```text
## Verify-before-done report
- What changed:
- Interaction map:
- Verified: (path → method → pass/fail)
- Bugs found in verify pass:
- Residual risks:
```

Full law: https://github.com/martialsystems/verify-before-done  
(or copy `VERIFY_BEFORE_DONE.md` into this repo)

This law wins over speed when declaring success.

